export const helpTopics=[['Starting care','Choose a service or browse the provider directory, then use the consultation request form. The form is currently in testing mode; it does not confirm an appointment.'],['Therapy or psychiatry?','Therapy focuses on conversations and psychological support. A psychiatrist is a medical doctor who can assess whether medical treatment is appropriate. You can ask which professional is suitable before booking.'],['Fees and insurance','Fees depend on the provider and service. Confirm the total cost, cancellation policy, and any insurer requirements before booking. No insurer coverage or reimbursement is guaranteed here.'],['Care for teenagers','A parent or legal guardian should make the initial enquiry. Consent, privacy, age eligibility, and the involvement of caregivers are discussed with the clinician before sessions.'],['Online or in person','Available formats depend on the provider, location, and clinical suitability. A clinician may recommend in-person assessment where appropriate.'],['Messaging and appointments','This website accepts test enquiries. It does not yet host therapy video calls, private patient messages, payments, or live appointment scheduling.'],['Privacy','Test enquiries are stored securely for authorized administrators. Do not enter medical records or personal health details. Screening on external websites follows those sites’ privacy policies.'],['Urgent help','The enquiry form is not monitored for emergencies. If there is immediate danger or a medical emergency, contact local emergency services or visit the nearest emergency department.']];
